---
description: Web accessibility
globs:
  - **/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

- semantic HTML first
- label every input (`Label` + `htmlFor`)
- keyboard reachable controls
- `aria-label` on icon-only buttons
- `focus-visible` over `focus`; never `outline-none` without replacement ring
- interactive controls: 40px min hit area; adjacent targets must not overlap
- never colour alone for state — pair with icon or text
- fields: `id`, `aria-invalid`, `aria-describedby` for errors; focus first error on submit
- polled regions: `aria-live="polite"` and `aria-busy`
- one `<h1>` per page; hierarchical headings; skip link to main
- native `<dialog>` via `showModal()` with `aria-labelledby` and focus return
- honour `prefers-reduced-motion`
- `Intl.DateTimeFormat` / `Intl.NumberFormat` over hardcoded formats
- images need `width`, `height`, and `alt`
- `translate="no"` on brand names and identifiers
- colour contrast per WCAG AA
- prefer native elements over div buttons
- `scroll-margin-top` on anchor targets
